Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,《You'll never walk alone》\N《你永远不会独行》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When you walk through a storm\N♪ 当你穿过风暴时 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your head up high\N♪ 抬起你的头颅 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't be afraid of the dark\N♪ 不要害怕黑暗 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of a storm\N♪ 在风暴的尽头 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a golden sky\N♪ 有一片金色的天空 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And the sweet silver song of a lark\N♪ 还有云雀甜美的银歌声 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on through the wind\N♪ 在风中继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on through the rain\N♪ 在雨中继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Though your dreams be tossed and blown\N♪ 哪怕梦想被风雨打落吹散 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on\N♪ 继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk on\N♪ 继续前行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,With hope in your heart\N♪ 心中怀有希望 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll never walk alone\N♪ 你永远不会独行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never walk alone\N♪ 你永远不会独行 ♪
